Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.70-rt103 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.70 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: c7b6ab5168c4271e6ecacc22ae4e7dffbd6d8e36


Or to build 3.2.70-rt103 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.70.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.70-rt103.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
